The [[Online (open beta)|online beta]] received a patch on January 6th, 2024, announced on [https://twitter.com/tyronerodriguez/status/1743732242734854247 Twitter].

== Documented Changes ==
* {{m|Revive Machine}}s added to each floor
** Reviving a player costs 10 coins
** Exploding the revive machine sometimes drops an eternal heart
* {{p|XIX - The Sun}} card + Isaac's Bed heals all players
* Co-op ghosts flight + can interact with some objects
* Co-op ghosts revived by eternal heart
* Left-Alt/L3 emote wheel

=== Fixes ===
* Starting items are accessible if unlocked
* {{c|The Lost}} and {{c|Tainted Lost}} health after revival corrected
* {{i|Schoolbag}} don’t drop 2nd active item on death
* Rerun save issue
* No [[Victory Lap]] Completion Mark
* Cannot join Victory Lap in progress
* Revival cosmetic issues
* Runs unjoinable when victory lap begins
* {{c|Tainted ???}} with {{i|Birthright}} correct poop limit

